@startuml
!include drivehub-sequence-theme.puml
title Prenotazione di un noleggio

actor Customer
participant "Controller JavaFX" as UI #D5E8D4
participant "RentalService" as Rental #FFF2CC
participant "TransactionRunner" as TX #FFF2CC
participant "UnitOfWork / DAO" as DAO #DAE8FC
participant "PricingService /\nPricingStrategy" as Pricing #FFF2CC
participant "BankAccount" as Account #F8CECC
participant "InventoryObserver" as Observer #F8CECC

Customer -> UI : conferma date e veicolo
UI -> Rental : bookRental(clientId, vehicleId, start, end)
Rental -> Rental : valida le date
Rental -> TX : execute(work)
TX -> DAO : begin()
Rental -> DAO : carica Vehicle [RENT]; verifica sovrapposizioni
DAO --> Rental : esito
alt intervallo occupato
  Rental --> TX : ConflictException
  TX -> DAO : rollback()
  Rental --> UI : errore di disponibilita
else intervallo libero
  Rental -> Pricing : calculateRentalPrice(vehicle, giorni inclusivi)
  Pricing --> Rental : importo
  Rental -> DAO : carica BankAccount
  Rental -> Account : withdraw(importo)
  Rental -> DAO : aggiorna saldo; salva Rent
  Rental -> DAO : annulla test drive nel periodo
  opt observer registrati
    Rental -> Observer : onInventoryEvent(TEST_DRIVES_CANCELLED)
  end
  TX -> DAO : commit()
  Rental --> UI : Rent salvato
end

note over UI,DAO
  Il gateway inoltra la chiamata del controller.
  Le scritture JDBC condividono la transazione.
  La notifica precede il commit.
end note
@enduml
